# The repo is CRLF (.editorconfig sets end_of_line = crlf). Normalizing here rather than
# leaving it to each machine's core.autocrlf is what keeps a clone on CI byte-identical to
# one on a workstation. text=auto still detects binaries, so the icon is left alone.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# Vendored third-party code ships exactly as it came: noVNC and xterm.js are LF, the
# Mokaterm patches in them are tracked by hand, and normalizing would rewrite every file
# and make the next upstream diff unreadable.
src/Modules/Mokaterm.Modules.Vnc/wwwroot/lib/** -text
src/UI/Mokaterm.UI.Terminal/wwwroot/lib/** -text

*.ico binary
